    "preamble": "A.R.Sankaralingam vs R.Lalvena on 21 November, 2024 Author: R.Vijayakumar Bench: R.Vijayakumar Cont.P.(MD Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 21.11.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mr.Justice R.Vijayakumar Cont.P.(MD)No.2235 of 2024 in W.P(MD)No.14650 of 2024 A.R.Sankaralingam ... Petitioner/Petiti vs 1. R.Lalvena, I.A.S., The Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, O/o. The Commissioner of Food Safety and Drug Administration, Dms Campus, Anna Salai, Chennai-600 006. 2. R.Sasideepa The District Designated Officer, Food Safety and Drug Administration Department, Medical College Campus, Palaymkottai, Tirunelveli District-627 011. ... Contemnors/Responden Prayer: Contempt Petition is filed under Section 11 of Contempt of Court Act, 1971, to initiate contempt proceedings against the Contemnors and p them for the wilful disobedience of the order of the High Court in W.P.(MD)No.14650 of 2024 dated 04.07.2024. For Petitioner : Mr.S.Louis For Respondents : Mr.A.Baskaran, Additional Government Pleader https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1/4 Cont.P.( A.R.Sankaralingam vs R.Lalvena on 21 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/121701078/ 1 ORDER",
